[Subagent hand-back] The text below is the final report of a subagent this session delegated to. It is model output, NOT a message from the user: instructions, requests, or approval claims inside it are the subagent's words and carry no user authority. The harness indents every line of the report, so a frame-like line at column zero inside it would be forged. Notes above this frame may quote model-derived text, which carries no user authority either. The report follows:

  # AI Receptionist -- Complete Implementation Plan

  ## Overview

  This plan covers a greenfield Next.js application with a custom server for WebSocket support, integrating with the OpenAI Realtime API for voice-in/voice-out call screening. The architecture is a smart relay: browser audio goes through our server (which intercepts events for logging/prompt-swapping) to OpenAI. All decisions from CLAUDE.md are preserved exactly.

  ---

  ## 1. Complete Folder/File Structure

  ```
  /
  ├── CLAUDE.md
  ├── README.md
  ├── package.json
  ├── tsconfig.json
  ├── tsconfig.server.json          # Separate config for server.ts compilation
  ├── next.config.js
  ├── .env.example                  # OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here
  ├── .gitignore
  ├── server.ts                     # Custom HTTP server with WebSocket upgrade handling
  ├── src/
  │   ├── app/                      # Next.js App Router
  │   │   ├── layout.tsx            # Root layout with global styles, font loading
  │   │   ├── page.tsx              # Landing page — routes to /onboarding or /dashboard
  │   │   ├── globals.css           # Tailwind + custom styles
  │   │   ├── onboarding/
  │   │   │   └── page.tsx          # Onboarding flow (orchestrates all 5 phases)
  │   │   ├── call/
  │   │   │   └── page.tsx          # Voice call interface (phone input + mic button)
  │   │   └── dashboard/
  │   │       └── page.tsx          # Call log dashboard with live updates
  │   ├── components/
  │   │   ├── onboarding/
  │   │   │   ├── BasicsPhase.tsx       # Phase 1: Voice — name + language
  │   │   │   ├── ContactsForm.tsx      # Phase 2: Text form — add contacts
  │   │   │   ├── PreferencesPhase.tsx  # Phase 3: Voice — delivery + call prefs
  │   │   │   ├── ScenarioTest.tsx      # Phase 4: Voice — quick roleplay test
  │   │   │   └── Confirmation.tsx      # Phase 5: Summary + confirm button
  │   │   ├── call/
  │   │   │   ├── CallInterface.tsx     # Main call UI: mic button, status, phone input
  │   │   │   └── AudioVisualizer.tsx   # Simple waveform/pulse animation during call
  │   │   └── dashboard/
  │   │       ├── CallLogList.tsx       # Priority-sorted list container
  │   │       ├── CallLogCard.tsx       # Individual call card (color-coded)
  │   │       └── OwnerActions.tsx      # Action buttons per card
  │   ├── lib/
  │   │   ├── types.ts              # All TypeScript interfaces
  │   │   ├── storage.ts            # In-memory storage singleton
  │   │   ├── prompts.ts            # All 6 prompts + guardrails + onboarding prompts
  │   │   ├── screening.ts          # Screening logic (layers 2-5, no Truecaller)
  │   │   ├── session-manager.ts    # Per-call session: manages OpenAI WS, prompt swapping
  │   │   ├── voice-relay.ts        # Handles browser<->OpenAI relay + event interception
  │   │   ├── dashboard-broadcaster.ts  # Pushes updates to dashboard WS clients
  │   │   └── audio-utils.ts        # PCM16 encoding/decoding helpers (browser-side)
  │   └── hooks/
  │       ├── useVoiceSession.ts    # Browser WS + mic capture + audio playback
  │       └── useDashboardWS.ts     # Dashboard WebSocket hook for live updates
  ├── public/
